ment for `custom-service` shows 0/3 replicas available, indicating potential issues with its pods. Checking the actual pod status in the `social-network` namespace will confirm if the pods are crashing, pending, or in an error state, which is critical to identifying the root cause of the fault.', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=343, prompt_tokens=2454, total_tokens=2797, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfd10-9535-7e31-bb55-a3b8f3e65065-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2454, 'output_tokens': 343, 'total_tokens': 2797}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='19000ec7-9b80-44fe-931d-6e806a35d190')]]
