ted    56s   kubelet            spec.initContainers{hang-init}: Created container: hang-init\n  Normal  Started    55s   kubelet            spec.initContainers{hang-init}: Started container hang-init\n', id='43f36e42-520d-4446-8a0d-2e8ea8450ef9', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-818194292dcc43f3'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='44af8305-21ee-43fb-a9fa-31bd790d509f')]]
